 397:Drivers/CMSIS/Include/cmsis_gcc.h **** /**
 398:Drivers/CMSIS/Include/cmsis_gcc.h ****   \brief   Count leading zeros
 399:Drivers/CMSIS/Include/cmsis_gcc.h ****   \details Counts the number of leading zeros of a data value.
